---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
		<style>
			img {
				display: block;
				margin: auto;
				border-radius: 12px;
				box-shadow: var(--box-shadow);
				width: 35%;
				}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>🤓 Hello!</h1>
			<img src="https://sc.amu.edu.pl/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/IMG_0155-scaled.jpg" alt="Portrait photo">
			<p>
				My name is Adam Ochwat and I am a <b>social researcher</b> based in Warsaw, Poland 🇵🇱. My interests lie at the intersection of historical sociology, economic history and higher education studies. I am currently in my final year of MA in sociology at the University of Warsaw. 
				I have experience in historical and qualitative research. My main fields of interest are: the Polish capitalist transformation (1980s and 1990s), history of Polish economics and sociology, and student movements. 
			</p>

			<p>Here are my research activities at a glance:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Student researcher at the <a href="https://sc.amu.edu.pl">Scholarly Communication Research Group</a> at Adam Mickiewicz University: 2024–</code></li>
				<ul>
					<li>Co-authored article on student clubs and primitive accumulation for the <a href="https://www.praktykateoretyczna.pl/call-for-papers/terapia-szokowa-a-narodziny-peryferyjnego-kapitalizmu-akademickiego-w-polsce-1990-1999/">December 2026 issue</a> of Praktyka Teoretyczna</li>
					<li>Contributed chapters to the upcoming <a href="https://sc.amu.edu.pl/projects/the-consequences-of-the-shock-therapy-for-science-and-higher-education/">report</a> on the consequences of shock therapy of the 1990s for higher education in Poland</li>
					<li>Presented preliminary research results at Historical Materialism Istanbul and Young Sociologists' Congress in Cracow (April 2026)</li>
					
				</ul>
			</ul>
			<p>Here is my tl;dr CV:</p>
			<ul>
				<li> 2027: Expected MA in Sociology (MISH College @ University of Warsaw) </li>
					<ul><li>Thesis: <i>Student clubs at the University of Warsaw in the period of transformation</i> Supervisors: prof. Maciej Gdula & prof. Krystian Szadkowski</li></ul>
				<li> 2025: BA in Philosophy (MISH UW)</li>
					<ul><li>Thesis: <i>Neoliberalism in Poland’s transformation at the turn of the 1980s and 1990s</i> Supervisor: Michał Siermiński, PhD (Polish Academy of Sciences)</li></ul>
				<li> 2024: BA in Sociology (MISH UW)</li>
				<li> 2020–21: BSc Mathematics and Economics @ University of Bristol (dropped out)</li>
			</ul>
			<p>And a few of my non-academic texts (in Polish):</p>
			<ul>
			<li><a href="https://mlodzi.ozzip.pl/news/mlodzi-pracownicy-umyslowi-80-lat-karty-z-grenoble-i-francuskiego-syndykalizmu-studenckiego">80 years of student syndicalism in France</a></li>
			<li><a href="https://mlodzi.ozzip.pl/news/krotka-historia-kradziezy-outsourcing-na-polskich-uczelniach-na-przykladzie-stolowek">Outsourcing of canteens at Polish universities</a></li>
			<li><a href="https://supabase.mlodzi.ozzip.pl/storage/v1/object/public/ebooks/files/ALARM_STUDENCKI_10_06d46032-e6e8-4f00-a84e-3e5ec9461c5e.pdf">(Un)finished history of student mutual aid in Poland</a></li>
			</ul>
			<p>Feel free to contact me at adamochwat [at] yahoo.com </p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
